      "message": "It\u0027s what the network active notification behaved currently.\n\nThe possible notification for the activity change is\n1. Data activity in underlying network is changed from false to true\n2. New default network is configured.\n\nYou could refer to the design in ConnectivityService#makeDefault().\n(makeDefault() -\u003e setupDataActivityTracking() -\u003e reportNetworkActive())\n\nIt always send the notification in 2, so I think we do not need to generate the condition 1 to trigger the notification. Condition 1 will also take much more time to verify the behavior.",
